{"ts":"2026-08-03T20:38:18.150Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"a545a9913b819cf59b42cd3e","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"1","source":"environment"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.220","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-08-03T20:38:18.150Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"A live instance of the exact structural blind spot this gate is scoped to, observed 2026-08-03 in the failing Windows nightly leg.\n\nThe failing assertion is in the agent runtime provenance suite, on the test that extracts bounded model and version fields from a harness session file. The value under test is a directory name that must be byte-identical to one produced by an external harness this repository does not control. The test does not assert against a captured sample. It rebuilds the expected name in the test body, branching on platform, using the same rule the production code uses.\n\nThat construction can only fail when the two restatements of one rule disagree, which is what happened on Windows and what did not happen on POSIX. On POSIX it is a tautology: the test passes because both sides encode the same assumption, including the case where the shared assumption is wrong. The external contract is never exercised on any platform.\n\nThis is the inventory entry this gate exists to reject, and it is worth keeping as the reference instance because it shows the failure mode is not hypothetical: the same test was simultaneously unable to fail on one platform and unable to pass on another, and neither outcome tested the boundary. A captured sample from a real harness project directory would have decided both.\n\nRecorded as evidence and as a candidate first fixture, not as a second item.\n"}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-03T20:38:18.150Z"}],"before_hash":"7821498dbabd7782e7ce106a443c5129917fd4236a5b31d7ad3728d7745316dd","after_hash":"8e0f6079908fdc1116bec70b89674e6e82a51232eacc9d9c3ec1cecf9797e462"}
